questions.explanation:
Let $$A = \left[ {\matrix{
   a &amp; b  \cr 
   b &amp; c  \cr 

 } } \right]$$

${A^2} = \left[ {\matrix{
   a &amp; b  \cr 
   b &amp; c  \cr 

 } } \right]\left[ {\matrix{
   a &amp; b  \cr 
   b &amp; c  \cr 

 } } \right] = \left[ {\matrix{
   {{a^2} + {b^2}} &amp; {ab + bc}  \cr 
   {ab + bc} &amp; {{c^2} + {b^2}}  \cr 

 } } \right]$$

$$ = {a^2} + 2{b^2} + {c^2} = 1$$

$$a = 1,b = 0,c = 0$$

$$a = 0,b = 0,c = 1$$

$$a =  - 1,b = 0,c = 0$$

$$c =  - 1,b = 0,a = 0$$

